# sha256 of the Rust 1.94.1 components the helper is built with (D65-A). toolchain.sh downloads
# nothing else and installs nothing that does not match a line here.
#
# Each value was checked against three independent sources when it was written, and they agreed:
#   1. the digest computed from the downloaded tarball;
#   2. the digest in the file published next to it (<tarball>.sha256);
#   3. `xz_hash` in https://static.rust-lang.org/dist/channel-rust-1.94.1.toml
#      (sha256 of that manifest: cc2f04dfc883549d683c8cc2a9393f523a3dfbd931f5d5eaef00303cca64a60d).
# The toolchain is the x86_64 Linux host's; the two rust-std musl components are what it compiles
# the helper for. rustc must report commit e408947bf (checked by toolchain.sh after installing).
